WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:05.180
A club shop is a shop inside your shop.

2
00:00:05.620 --> 00:00:08.420
One for a school, a club or a company's own uniform.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
They all go up the same way. This one is a school.

4
00:00:12.820 --> 00:00:15.460
Name it, then set the code its products will carry.

5
00:00:16.180 --> 00:00:20.100
Add the shop logo and a banner. Both show on the school's own page.

6
00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:25.860
Decide who gets in. Open to anyone, or only parents and members holding a code.

7
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:31.060
Create the shop. Now put the uniform in it, a school tie.

8
00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:37.300
Price it, say what the price already covers,
and whether it is zero rated for children's clothing.

9
00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:41.900
Add it to the shop. A polo shirt goes in the same way.

10
00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:45.400
Pick the sizes and the ages the shop will offer.

11
00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:50.420
Now give the shop its own web address. Two records at your domain.

12
00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:56.000
A CNAME to point the address at the shop,
and a TXT record to prove the domain is yours.

13
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:00.400
It can take fifteen minutes, or three or four hours, then check it.

14
00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:06.000
There is the shop on its own address,
with the two products, the banner and the logo you uploaded.

15
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.900
That is a club shop.

16
00:01:08.440 --> 00:01:13.220
Our team will set up the domain records for you,
and once they are done you never touch them again.
